msgid ""
"We make reasonable efforts to deliver letters on the scheduled date using "
"automated systems and retry logic. Delivery can be affected by invalid "
"addresses, recipient-side filtering, mailbox limits, third-party service "
"outages, legal restrictions, or technical events outside our control. When "
"possible, we will surface delivery problems in your account so you can "
"review them."
msgstr ""
"Мы прилагаем разумные усилия для доставки писем в запланированную дату, "
